### Library API lab (IntelliJ HTTP Client). Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=orwell

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/99

### Valid
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Refactoring", "author": "Martin Fowler", "isbn": "9780134757599", "year": 2018, "copies": 4}

### Invalid: every rule broken (expect 400 with an errors map)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "", "author": "", "isbn": "123", "year": 1200, "copies": -1}

### Duplicate ISBN (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Another 1984", "author": "George Orwell", "isbn": "9780451524935", "year": 1949, "copies": 1}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
